WEBVTT

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:08.070
Everyone says that the starry sky is beautiful.

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:13.070
But I don't remember what it looks like.

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.700
It's not that I hate it.
Actually, it's more like I'm afraid.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.500
I can't even look up at it.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:27.090
To me, the "starry sky" just looked like pitch-black darkness.

00:00:28.380 --> 00:00:33.550
I had someone to protect me, but I still...

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:46.730
Say, how many people live in this town?

00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:51.780
It's 2,040, according to the latest info.

00:00:56.280 --> 00:01:00.540
How splendid! Magnificent!

00:01:00.540 --> 00:01:05.420
Then that means today, my collection...

00:01:06.370 --> 00:01:09.290
is getting 2,040 new pieces!

00:01:09.290 --> 00:01:11.630
Now isn't that amazing?!

00:01:15.010 --> 00:01:16.800
Zakuro-chan...

00:03:15.170 --> 00:03:18.050
I can feel the power coursing through me!

00:03:26.890 --> 00:03:28.390
Shortcu—

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:30.850
Kotoha-chin!

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:31.940
Kotoha-chan!

00:03:32.560 --> 00:03:35.400
I might have pushed myself a little too far.

00:03:36.820 --> 00:03:37.610
Akina!

00:03:39.690 --> 00:03:41.200
Baton pass.

00:03:42.360 --> 00:03:46.410
That girl is half-human, just like me.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:48.910
Please...

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:51.910
Save her.

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:56.670
Only you can do it.

00:03:57.750 --> 00:03:58.590
Got it.

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:07.430
Let's give this a try!

00:04:07.810 --> 00:04:08.770
Kyousuke!

00:04:11.890 --> 00:04:14.150
Get away from me!

00:04:18.730 --> 00:04:20.780
I see.

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:24.110
The control mechanism is still the same.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:29.040
So? What do you want, land god?

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.460
You dropped this.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:39.750
You've been watching this whole time?

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.800
This is my town.

00:04:42.470 --> 00:04:43.550
Hey now.

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.640
I thought land gods weren't allowed to interfere.

00:04:47.640 --> 00:04:49.310
Did I forget to tell you?

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:52.310
Those kids are in my care.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.140
I won't let you make them cry.

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.570
Huh? A blackout?

00:05:01.980 --> 00:05:04.070
Don't let your guard down.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.280
Hime!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:14.080
K-Kyousuke still has his shackle on.
Was he always this strong?

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.210
That's not going to work.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:23.420
Our mayor would never hurt her own.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.840
Just look at you now.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.430
You can't help anyone!

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:32.770
Hime!

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:37.520
Milady, stand back!

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:48.530
Give Rin back to us!

00:05:49.320 --> 00:05:50.780
Oh, buzz off.

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:53.080
Hime!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:54.040
Milady!

00:05:57.920 --> 00:06:00.040
Give Rin... back to us!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:02.040
Shut the hell up!

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:09.390
Don't worry.

00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:12.010
You'll be under my control in just—

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:19.020
Don't underestimate me!

00:06:29.860 --> 00:06:34.290
Neither my body nor my will is weak enough to fall under your control!

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:38.210
Tuning!

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:42.790
Kyousuke!

00:06:43.290 --> 00:06:46.300
Akina, stop! Kyousuke! Akina!

00:06:52.180 --> 00:06:53.140
I can move again?

00:06:55.010 --> 00:06:59.310
He only tuned the darkness controlling Kyousuke!
That was his grandpa's favorite move!

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:02.310
It's pretty tough to control properly, though.

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:06.690
Akina could save her with that.

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:09.490
As if I'd let you lay a finger on me!

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:22.960
I'm done playing around! Let's finish this!

00:07:27.630 --> 00:07:28.670
Rin!

00:07:30.550 --> 00:07:31.550
Go!

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:41.770
<i>Still</i> resisting, huh?

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.320
What a useless toy.

00:07:46.320 --> 00:07:48.440
Just leave us alone!

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:50.440
It's fine!

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:54.120
I hate you! I hate you all!

00:07:56.580 --> 00:08:00.160
So just leave me be!

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:03.870
Fantastic!

00:08:22.440 --> 00:08:23.850
We're going after Zakuro!

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:26.400
Why bother?

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:31.650
Rin seems to hate the town anyway.

00:08:31.650 --> 00:08:32.900
Go home then.

00:08:33.400 --> 00:08:36.870
If you're not set on saving her, then you'll just be in the way.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:38.580
Ao, lead the way!

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:38.910
Okay.

00:08:39.410 --> 00:08:41.290
Boss, Master, let's go!

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:42.410
Right.

00:08:55.760 --> 00:08:58.430
Milady, if you'll excuse me for a bit.

00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:01.390
Hime!

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:09.400
I wanted to serve as your secretary

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:13.740
because I was touched by your ideals and determination to make this town better.

00:09:14.900 --> 00:09:16.530
This is a good town.

00:09:17.110 --> 00:09:18.200
You should be more confident.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:23.700
But she said she hated us all. How could I...

00:09:23.700 --> 00:09:24.710
Don't worry.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:27.880
She didn't mean it.

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:31.300
Anyone who lives here would tell you that.

00:09:31.300 --> 00:09:33.710
And I've been here a decade, so take my word for it.

00:09:34.260 --> 00:09:35.420
I'm sure.

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.270
Hello?

00:09:46.270 --> 00:09:47.600
Hime-chan?

00:09:47.600 --> 00:09:49.150
Junta's grandma?

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:50.360
Where are you?

00:09:55.190 --> 00:09:56.900
No one's here.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.620
God dammit...

00:10:00.240 --> 00:10:01.870
Where the hell are you?!

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:05.910
We're in the civic hall outside of town.

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:07.620
Everyone from town is here.

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:10.380
That's right. Everyone.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.250
We're having a tea party.

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:14.130
Hold on for a moment.

00:10:14.460 --> 00:10:16.340
Give it here already.

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.930
Ah, Hime?

00:10:18.930 --> 00:10:22.390
All of us are over here, drinking tea.

00:10:22.390 --> 00:10:24.470
Uh, whatever you're doing,

00:10:24.470 --> 00:10:26.390
when you're done, be sure to come by.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:29.230
Old man Jinroku...

00:10:29.230 --> 00:10:35.860
And if you see Rin, tell her we'll try one of her new ramen recipes tomorrow for lunch.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:37.860
Maybe I'll have a bowl too.

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:40.360
Three bowls then! Be sure to tell her!

00:10:40.870 --> 00:10:41.820
Gotcha.

00:10:45.040 --> 00:10:47.660
Let's go, milady.

00:10:47.660 --> 00:10:49.920
Rin is waiting for us.

00:10:59.180 --> 00:11:00.930
I'm fine now.

00:11:05.850 --> 00:11:06.930
Besides...

00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.230
I haven't used my trump card yet.

00:11:15.520 --> 00:11:18.440
Akina, maybe we should just give up.

00:11:18.940 --> 00:11:20.950
What the hell are you even talking about?

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:25.450
Well, Rin said she doesn't want to stay in town.

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:29.210
Have you forgotten why Rin came to this town?

00:11:30.080 --> 00:11:34.540
She suffered so much, she wanted to be sent to the other side!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:38.010
But did she ever say that she wanted to be sent over

00:11:38.010 --> 00:11:40.880
even once since she started living with you?

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:45.350
I for one never heard her bring it up.

00:11:50.680 --> 00:11:51.850
Found them!

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:01.110
Let's do this.

00:12:02.070 --> 00:12:03.280
You're late!

00:12:03.280 --> 00:12:04.160
Sorry.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:11.120
Akina!

00:12:12.580 --> 00:12:13.580
Good luck!

00:12:44.910 --> 00:12:47.910
Zakuro-chan, haven't you done enough?

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.790
I've learned a bunch of recipes!

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.920
I'll cook something for you!

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:58.540
I've learned so much!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:12:59.500
So—

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:02.010
You must love flapping those lips, huh?

00:13:04.380 --> 00:13:07.340
Why?! Why isn't anyone here?!

00:13:07.340 --> 00:13:08.100
Zakuro!

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:18.230
Damn. What an annoying bunch.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:36.000
Here we go!

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:37.580
Let's do this!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:46.340
Akina!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:49.550
Tuning...

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:54.810
Akina-san!

00:13:56.560 --> 00:13:58.060
Oh, shoot.

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:08.570
Huh?

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.870
You're doing great.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:13.080
Th-Thanks.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.540
You okay, Akina?

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:16.750
I'm fine!

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.590
We'll never get close to her like this, though.

00:14:26.880 --> 00:14:28.130
Power's back.

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:40.150
All right.

00:14:40.150 --> 00:14:41.980
Akina-chin, you okay?

00:14:44.480 --> 00:14:45.530
Ao!

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:46.990
Yes?

00:14:46.990 --> 00:14:49.450
Could you handle sending a
message with your telepathy?

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:52.620
If it's not too complicated.

00:15:06.460 --> 00:15:07.510
I can't get close.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:20.270
Special... delivery!

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:26.940
Sounds like a plan.

00:15:28.440 --> 00:15:31.780
Kyousuke, ready...

00:15:31.780 --> 00:15:33.780
What are you mumbling about?!

00:15:34.280 --> 00:15:35.280
Go!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.130
Hime-chan!

00:15:52.930 --> 00:15:54.970
Please, stop already!

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:57.810
I'll leave with you, so let's go!

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.390
You can't, Rin.

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:01.560
Stay here with us!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:04.060
No, I'm leaving!

00:16:04.440 --> 00:16:06.480
I'll live with Zakuro-chan.

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:08.030
That's for the best!

00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:08.690
You can't!

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:11.820
Shut up...

00:16:12.150 --> 00:16:13.570
Be quiet!

00:16:29.590 --> 00:16:30.510
Shoot!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.260
I got you!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.800
Both of you, stop already!

00:16:35.800 --> 00:16:37.010
Please!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:38.260
I can't!

00:16:38.260 --> 00:16:39.220
Be quiet!

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:43.520
Please, stop!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:44.520
I can't!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:46.770
Hime-chan...

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:51.030
Shut up already!

00:17:00.910 --> 00:17:02.450
I won't let you escape.

00:17:02.450 --> 00:17:03.620
Hime-chan!

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.760
This is where you die.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:14.880
Kyousuke!

00:17:27.310 --> 00:17:28.110
They're here!

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:29.400
Touka-chan!

00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.650
I'm on it!

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:35.200
Whatever you're up to... It's all pointless!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.870
As long as I fight in this town...

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:41.660
I won't lose!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:47.580
As long as I'm loved by this town, its people, and the dragon...

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:52.670
As long as I have the Dragon Lance!

00:17:53.960 --> 00:17:55.760
That's the Dragon Lance?

00:17:55.760 --> 00:17:56.430
I don't believe it.

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:59.680
How could the Dragon Pulse possibly flow through here?

00:18:07.730 --> 00:18:09.190
It can't.

00:18:11.690 --> 00:18:14.150
Tuning!

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:31.250
<i>Let's live together.</i>

00:18:31.670 --> 00:18:33.960
<i>I'll protect you.</i>

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.220
Rin!

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:51.650
<i>As long as someone's protecting me...</i>

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.980
<i>I'll probably never come to like the starry sky.</i>

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:57.900
<i>But...</i>

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.910
<i>Right now...</i>

00:19:00.660 --> 00:19:03.160
<i>As I try to protect another...</i>

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.990
<i>I feel like there's nothing to be afraid of.</i>

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:11.460
<i>So, in my final moments, I'll burn the image into my eyes.</i>

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:16.170
<i>The image of the bright, beautiful...</i>

00:19:22.300 --> 00:19:23.180
Rin!

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:29.270
Aki—

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.940
Why are you guys falling too?!

00:19:31.940 --> 00:19:33.230
I'm not too sure, really.

00:19:33.230 --> 00:19:34.190
We're falling!

00:19:34.190 --> 00:19:35.730
Onii-chan!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.190
I'll cushion our fall.

00:19:37.190 --> 00:19:38.440
That's ridiculous. I will!

00:19:38.740 --> 00:19:40.650
No, I will!

00:19:40.650 --> 00:19:42.200
No, me!

00:19:43.700 --> 00:19:45.780
Th-Then, I will.

00:19:46.950 --> 00:19:48.410
Go right on ahead.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:19:59.970
Jeez.

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:03.010
You're all out of your minds.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:33.120
Hime-cha—

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:37.920
Don't ever do that again.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:39.670
I want you here with us.

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:43.430
No matter...

00:20:44.800 --> 00:20:48.260
No matter how much you come to hate us.

00:20:55.400 --> 00:20:59.940
How could I ever hate any of you?

00:21:15.580 --> 00:21:16.210
Akina!

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:17.790
Akina-san!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:22.800
Juri-san...

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:24.800
Mister...

00:21:26.640 --> 00:21:27.800
Good work.

00:21:31.770 --> 00:21:33.770
She appears to have been tuned cleanly,

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.310
but I'll take her to the clinic to be safe.

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.230
Thanks. Take care of her.

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:41.020
Rin, wanna come over today?

00:21:42.230 --> 00:21:46.990
I'm thinking of going to the clinic too.

00:21:47.610 --> 00:21:48.320
Besides—

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:48.780
Rin.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:58.920
Mister, Boss...

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:06.550
Welcome back.

00:22:11.140 --> 00:22:11.890
I...

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:18.730
I'm home!

00:22:20.850 --> 00:22:30.880
I stomped my feet as the deceptively short time elapsed
nibe mo naku haran de banjou no maijikan to maifun

00:22:32.200 --> 00:22:37.460
In search of fate
maibyou no sanaka de

00:22:40.720 --> 00:22:50.660
This unshakable confidence isn't without misunderstandings
sukima naku naranda kanjou araizarai hanashite

00:22:51.940 --> 00:23:02.480
I believe in you. Let us love
kimi wo mitsumeteru aishiaou yo

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:19.180
We finally meet, my goddess
yatto deaeta megami yo

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:37.100
Hello hello. People meet one another...
Hello hello umaretekuru mae ni hito wa dareka to

00:23:37.100 --> 00:23:49.590
Hello hello. Before being born into the world
Hello hello machiawase wo shite umaretekita

00:23:50.200 --> 00:23:56.700
In a world without eternity
eien nante nai sekai de

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:07.710
You just have to pout for a while, huh?

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:13.390
I can't walk around with a fake smile and act like nothing happened.

00:24:13.390 --> 00:24:17.560
Accepting another resident means taking responsibility for another person.

00:24:18.640 --> 00:24:21.560
I'm the mayor, after all.

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:25.560
This whole thing is just the tip of the iceberg.

00:24:26.020 --> 00:24:26.980
District Mayor.

00:24:27.900 --> 00:24:30.440
The hunters will keep on coming.

00:24:30.440 --> 00:24:32.610
If you guys wanna stick to not killing any of them...

00:24:35.200 --> 00:24:36.830
not only will you need to drive them away,

00:24:38.450 --> 00:24:40.830
you'll need to accept them too.

00:24:45.130 --> 00:24:46.840
Things are gonna get rough.

00:24:46.840 --> 00:24:48.550
I'm sure they will.

00:24:48.550 --> 00:24:51.720
But I'm sure we'll have some fun...

00:24:51.720 --> 00:24:55.340
as we show them how to live happily here.

00:24:55.680 --> 00:24:56.470
That's right!

00:24:58.850 --> 00:25:00.350
As mayor...

00:25:00.890 --> 00:25:02.020
I'll make it happen!

00:25:03.520 --> 00:25:04.850
Sounds like a plan.

00:25:07.440 --> 00:25:10.480
Guess Hime-chan's still not over it, huh?

00:25:10.980 --> 00:25:14.990
I'm happy to have another
half-youkai around though.

00:25:15.910 --> 00:25:17.370
Don't worry about it!

00:25:18.490 --> 00:25:20.830
I mean, it <i>is</i> Hime-chan, after all.

00:25:32.050 --> 00:25:33.510
A certificate of residence...

00:25:34.300 --> 00:25:36.890
What'd I tell you? Isn't this great, Zakuro-chan?

00:25:36.890 --> 00:25:39.220
I think a check would have been cooler.

00:25:39.220 --> 00:25:41.720
Oh come on, Kotoha-chan!

00:25:41.720 --> 00:25:43.390
It is, right?

00:25:43.890 --> 00:25:44.680
Do you know how to fill it out?

00:25:44.680 --> 00:25:46.100
<i>I used the hate the starry sky
Do you know how to fill it out?</i>

00:25:46.100 --> 00:25:47.650
<i>I used the hate the starry sky</i>

00:25:47.650 --> 00:25:49.650
<i>that fascinated everyone else.</i>

00:25:50.270 --> 00:25:54.440
<i>But... now that I have someone to gaze at it with....</i>

00:25:54.440 --> 00:25:57.280
Rin-chan, I'll lay out the futons.

00:25:57.280 --> 00:25:58.410
Zakuro-chan.

00:26:00.620 --> 00:26:03.660
The stars are beautiful tonight too.

00:26:14.210 --> 00:26:19.550
The End
